{"id":841728,"title":"04｜GIT版本控制","content":"本节课主要讲解如何在科学环境中使用Git进行代码版本控制。由于国内访问GitHub不稳定，课程选择使用国内的Gitee作为远程仓库服务。学习版本控制的重要性在于避免代码修改过程中丢失良好版本。首先，在VS Code中安装Python扩展插件以便运行Python文件，并演示了Python的安装过程及环境变量配置。接着，介绍了Git的安装与配置，包括下载、安装步骤以及在VS Code中的初始化设置。通过创建Gitee账号并生成私人令牌，完成远程仓库的连接与认证。详细展示了如何提交代码至远程仓库，解决认证问题，并成功推送代码。最后，演示了如何使用命令行工具git revert回滚到特定版本，强调revert操作是恢复到指定提交之前的版本状态。通过这些步骤，学员能够掌握基本的Git操作和版本控制方法。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":397160,"user_name":"tom","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1052000,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"E1BF6FE83000DD","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/0d/60/4ca6a096.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1737079270,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144116,"content":"谢谢同学的肯定，祝你学习愉快","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1737101839,"ip_address":"河北","comment_id":397160,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"老师讲的很细致，非常适合初学者","like_count":4,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":656257,"discussion_content":"谢谢同学的肯定，祝你学习愉快","content_length":14,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1737101839,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"河北","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":397398,"user_name":"寒战🏈📚💻","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4075433,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"8E29AD98AAC59D","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/3e/2f/a9/79b3e03d.jpg","comment_is_top":fal